Third-party attribution
------------------------

The holographic card-foil effect in apps/web/app/globals.css
(the `.card3d__foil` / `.card3d__glare` rules and the associated
`--sunpillar-*` custom properties) is ported from:

  pokemon-cards-css
  Copyright (C) Simon Goellner (@simeydotme)
  https://github.com/simeydotme/pokemon-cards-css
  Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

Specifically, the following techniques and values were adapted from
that project's public/css/cards/*.css files:

  - the sunpillar color palette and rainbow gradient used for the
    holo sheen layer
  - the filter/mix-blend-mode combinations for the regular-holo,
    reverse-holo, and cosmos-holo presets
  - the clip-path "donut with slit" technique used to mask the
    reverse-holo sheen to the card's art window

